---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <div class="hero" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <img src="/header.png" alt="rohan roots" />
  </div>
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>SRE. K8s, Linux, AI infra. That's pretty much it.</p>
  <p>
    I write about what breaks at 2am and why: Kubernetes operations, Linux
    systems, self-hosted infrastructure, and the occasional AI agent
    experiment. Everything here is from the on-call SRE's point of view,
    not a tutorial account's.
  </p>
  <p>You can also find me on <a href="https://x.com/rohanroots">X</a>, <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/rohanroots.dev">Bluesky</a>, <a href="https://rohanroots.substack.com">Substack</a>, <a href="https://dev.to/rohan_roots">Dev.to</a>, and <a href="https://medium.com/@rohan_roots">Medium</a>.</p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Scoped here so it matches: the .hero div is rendered by this page. */
  .hero img { width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); }
</style>
